Subject: [PATCH 4/6] feat(kernel): expose distribution identity and build metadata

Normalized against the recorded local Linux 7.2.6 preimage.
Original source attribution and input bytes are retained in provenance/.

Validation: exact indexed forward/reverse application.
Kernel compilation, boot and hardware behavior remain unverified.

Assisted-by: Codex:GPT-6
---
diff --git a/include/linux/buildid.h b/include/linux/buildid.h
index 7acc06b22fb7d21b4dd4ffa16a4bfebe3d6e458d..943ddae36f03423052c8ec2a852053533325823f 100644
--- a/include/linux/buildid.h
+++ b/include/linux/buildid.h
@@ -14,7 +14,8 @@ int build_id_parse_file(struct file *file, unsigned char *build_id, __u32 *size)
 int build_id_parse_nofault(struct vm_area_struct *vma, unsigned char *build_id, __u32 *size);
 int build_id_parse_buf(const void *buf, unsigned char *build_id, u32 buf_size);
 
-#if IS_ENABLED(CONFIG_STACKTRACE_BUILD_ID) || IS_ENABLED(CONFIG_VMCORE_INFO)
+#if IS_ENABLED(CONFIG_STACKTRACE_BUILD_ID) || IS_ENABLED(CONFIG_VMCORE_INFO) || \
